  "name": "odd-tile-dark",
  "description": "The odd tile, dark: a 4 × 3 grid of the mark in a pale ink on a near-black ground tinted by the accent, faint rules, one tile (param `odd`) turned 45° on a square of the accent; the artist and title under the grid. Slots: {name} (artist), {title} (release), {mark}, the palette (accent), `odd`. Fonts: Inter Tight (register them as TTF/WOFF; WOFF2 can't be outlined).",
